----\n\nWhat happens next\n\n01\n\nWatch your inbox\n\nExact dates, hackathon briefs and final passes come to this address first.\n\n02\n\nJoin the channel\n\nLine-ups, venue changes and last-minute news land on our WhatsApp channel.\n\n03\n\nBring your ID\n\nShow %%ID%% at the registration desk. Lost this email? Find your pass on the website.\n\nJoin the WhatsApp channel https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb87N0c9Bb5utsX0yk2RFind my pass https://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/auth\n\nNACOS Week 2027 · Confluence\n\nWebsite https://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng  ·  Instagram https://www.instagram.com/nacos_aksu/  ·  X https://x.com/nacos_aksu  ·  WhatsApp https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb87N0c9Bb5utsX0yk2R\n\nNACOS AKSU, Faculty of Computing & Information Technology\nAkwa Ibom State University, Ikot Akpaden, Mkpat Enin, Akwa Ibom State\n\nYou received this because you registered at nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng. Questions? Reply to this email or write to hello@nacosaksu.com.ng."},"volunteer":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\"/><title>Application received for the %%TEAM%%. Your crew ID is %%ID%%.</title><style></style><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@600;700;800&amp;family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap\"/></head><body dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\" style=\"background-color:rgb(236,239,232);margin:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><!--body--><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\" style=\"margin:0;padding-bottom:32px;padding-top:32px;padding-right:12px;padding