80,18);text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:600\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp</a></p><p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:19px;margin:0;margin-top:14px;color:rgb(115,128,119);margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\">NACOS AKSU, Faculty of Computing &amp; Information Technology<br/>Akwa Ibom State University, <!-- -->Ikot Akpaden, Mkpat Enin, Akwa Ibom State</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:17px;margin:0;margin-top:10px;color:rgb(115,128,119);margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\">You received this because you follow NACOS Week 2027 updates.<!-- --> Questions? Reply to this email or write to<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:hello@nacosaksu.com.ng\" style=\"color:rgb(115,128,119);text-decoration-line:underline\" target=\"_blank\">hello@nacosaksu.com.ng</a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>","text":"https://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng\n\nConfluence\n\nFebruary 2027\n\n \n \n\nThe programme · February 2027\n\n\nFIVE EVENTS. ONE FLAGSHIP WEEK.\n\n%%FIRST%%, this is the year NACOS Week opens to the whole university. Every faculty and every student, meeting in one place. Here's what's on.\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nhttps://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/hackathon\n\n01 / Flagship\n\nHackathon\n\nA 4-week build across 4 industry tracks\n\nStudent teams build real solutions to briefs set by sector sponsors, then pitch them live at the Tech Conference.\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nhttps://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/programme\n\n02 / Conference\n\nTech Conference Day\n\nEnergy, FinTech, Oil & Gas, Medicine\n\nKeynotes and panels from industry, the hackathon exhibition, and live judging on the main stage.\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nhttps://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/programme\n\n03 / Sports\n\nFootball Tournament\n\nInter-faculty, open crowd\n\nThe whole campus on the touchline. Sportsmanship, rivalry and the loudest afternoon of the week.\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nhttps://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/programme\n\n04 / Culture\n\nFashion & Pageantry\n\nCrowning the Royal Council\n\nRunway, student creativity, and the selection of brand campus ambassadors for the year ahead.\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nhttps://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/programme\n\n05 / Celebration\n\nDinner & Award Night\n\nBlack tie, green carpet\n\nA formal evening to dine, network and honour students for character, scholarship and leadership.\n\n5\n\nFlagship pillars\n\n4\n\nIndustry tracks\n\n500\n\nMain hall seats\n\n30k+\n\nStudents on campus\n\nSeats in the main hall are limited\n\nRegister once. Pick the events you want.\n\nAdmission is free for all AKSU students. You'll get a registration ID to show at the door.\n\nRegister for NACOS Week https://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/registerFull programme https://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng/programme\n\nNACOS Week 2027 · Confluence\n\nWebsite https://nw27.nacosaksu.com.ng  ·  Instagram https://www.instagram.com/nacos_aksu/  ·  X https://x.com/nacos_aksu  ·  WhatsApp https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb87N0c9Bb5utsX0yk2R\n\nNACOS AKSU, Faculty of Computing & Information Technology\nAkwa Ibom State University, Ikot Akpaden, Mkpat Enin, Akwa Ibom State\n\nYou received this because you follow NACOS Week 2027 updates. Questions? Reply to this email or write to hello@nacosaksu.com.ng."},"partnership":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\"/><title>%%COMPANY%% x NACOS Week 2027: five events, 30,000+ students, one week in February.</title><style></style><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@600;700;800&amp;family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&amp;disp